// Selected content and artwork from the supplied xcellhost-entra-suite.html.
export const SUITE_CONTENT = "<section class=\"sec\" id=\"overview\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Overview</span><h2>Zero Trust as <span class=\"acc\">one licence, not four contracts.</span></h2></div>\n    <div class=\"pp-cols rv\">\n      <p class=\"pp-ov\"><b>Microsoft Entra Suite</b> bundles five Entra products into a single per-user licence: <b>Private Access</b> for internal apps without a VPN, <b>Internet Access</b> as an identity-aware web and AI gateway, <b>ID Governance</b> for joiners, movers and leavers, <b>ID Protection</b> at P2 level for risky sign-ins, and <b>Verified ID with Face Check</b> for high-assurance identity checks.</p>\n      <p class=\"pp-ov\">All five read the same user, device and risk signals, so a single <b>Conditional Access</b> policy covers private apps, websites, SaaS and AI tools. For Indian businesses still juggling a VPN box, a proxy appliance and access requests by email, it collapses that stack onto one Microsoft licence. Each user also needs Entra ID P1 — usually already in Microsoft 365 Business Premium or E3/E5. XcellHost bills it in INR and runs the migration with you.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"prov-strip rv\"><span class=\"prov-lbl\">Secures access to</span>\n      <span class=\"prov\"><span class=\"pl\" style=\"background:#0A2A57\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"13\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 7.5h.01M7 16.5h.01\"></path></svg></span>Internal apps &amp; ERP</span>\n      <span class=\"prov\"><span class=\"pl\" style=\"background:#1565D8\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 010 18M12 3a14 14 0 000 18\"></path></svg></span>Websites &amp; SaaS</span>\n      <span class=\"prov\"><span class=\"pl\" style=\"background:#FF8C1A\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 3a3 3 0 00-3 3 3 3 0 00-2 5 3 3 0 001 5 3 3 0 005 3V3zM15 3a3 3 0 013 3 3 3 0 012 5 3 3 0 01-1 5 3 3 0 01-5 3V3z\"></path></svg></span>Generative AI apps</span>\n      <span class=\"prov\"><span class=\"pl\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><span class=\"msq\"><i style=\"background:#F25022\"></i><i style=\"background:#7FBA00\"></i><i style=\"background:#00A4EF\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFB900\"></i></span></span>Microsoft 365</span>\n      <span class=\"prov\"><span class=\"pl\" style=\"background:#16a34a\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"></path></svg></span>Windows, Mac &amp; mobile</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">How the Suite works</span><h2>Shared signals. <span class=\"acc\">One policy.</span> Enforced everywhere.</h2><p>Identity, device and risk are evaluated once — then the same decision applies to apps, websites and AI tools.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"vgrid\">\n      <div class=\"vcard rv\"><span class=\"vb\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l3-8 4 16 3-8h4\"></path></svg>01 · Signals</span><h3>Who they are, and how risky</h3><p>Every request carries the user's identity and role, device compliance, location and a live risk score from ID Protection.</p><ul><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Verified identity &amp; group membership</li><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Device compliance &amp; location</li><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Sign-in and user risk in real time</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"vcard b2 rv\" data-d=\"1\"><span class=\"vb\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle></svg>02 · One policy</span><h3>Write the rule once</h3><p>\"Finance staff, compliant device, low risk, MFA\" — a single Conditional Access policy that every Suite product honours.</p><ul><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Report-only pilots before enforcement</li><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Access packages assigned from HR data</li><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Face Check for high-risk actions</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"vcard b3 rv\" data-d=\"2\"><span class=\"vb\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>03 · Enforcement</span><h3>Applied on every path</h3><p>The decision is enforced at the private-app tunnel, the web gateway and the sign-in itself — with one log to audit.</p><ul><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Per-app tunnels to RDP, SMB, SAP &amp; ERP</li><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Web, SaaS &amp; AI traffic filtering</li><li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></i>Unified sign-in &amp; traffic logs</li></ul></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"inside\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">What's inside</span><h2>Five products, <span class=\"acc\">one policy engine.</span></h2><p>Each part of the Suite is sold separately too. Bundled, they read the same user, device and risk signals — so one Conditional Access policy decides who gets into an app, a website or an AI tool.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ins-grid\">\n      <article class=\"card ins rv\">\n        <div class=\"ih\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"11\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 11V8a4 4 0 018 0v3\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"tagline\">Replaces your VPN</span></div>\n        <h3>Private Access</h3>\n        <p>Zero Trust network access to internal apps — per app, per user, with no inbound ports open.</p>\n        <ul class=\"ilist\">\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h8l-1 8 10-12h-8z\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Quick Access</b> — tunnel listed FQDNs and IP ranges with one-time setup</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3l9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5z\"></path><path d=\"M3 13l9 5 9-5M3 17.5l9 5 9-5\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Per-app access</b> for any TCP or UDP app, each with its own policy</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"13\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 7.5h.01M7 16.5h.01\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Connectors</b> on Windows Server, outbound-only over port 443</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 9l3 3-3 3M13 15h4\"></path></svg></i><span>MFA and SSO for RDP, SSH, SMB shares, SAP and legacy apps</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"more\" href=\"/microsoft-entra-private-access\">Explore Private Access <span class=\"ar\">→</span></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card ins rv\" data-d=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"ih\"><div class=\"ico o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 010 18M12 3a14 14 0 000 18\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"tagline\">Replaces your web proxy</span></div>\n        <h3>Internet Access</h3>\n        <p>An identity-aware secure web gateway for internet, SaaS and AI apps, enforced on the device.</p>\n        <ul class=\"ilist\">\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 4h18l-7 8v6l-4 2v-8z\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Web content filtering</b> by category and FQDN</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 3a3 3 0 00-3 3 3 3 0 00-2 5 3 3 0 001 5 3 3 0 005 3V3zM15 3a3 3 0 013 3 3 3 0 012 5 3 3 0 01-1 5 3 3 0 01-5 3V3z\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Shadow AI discovery</b> and prompt-injection protection</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2M17 3h2a2 2 0 012 2v2M21 17v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2M7 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2M3 12h18\"></path></svg></i><span>TLS inspection, threat-intel and file filtering</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"></path></svg></i><span>Client for Windows, macOS, iOS and Android</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"more\" href=\"/microsoft-entra-internet-access\">Explore Internet Access <span class=\"ar\">→</span></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card ins rv\" data-d=\"2\">\n        <div class=\"ih\"><div class=\"ico n\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><path d=\"M2 20a7 7 0 0114 0M17 11a3 3 0 000-6M22 20a6 6 0 00-4-5.6\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"tagline\">Replaces manual IGA</span></div>\n        <h3>ID Governance</h3>\n        <p>The full identity lifecycle — right access on day one, reviewed regularly, removed on the last day.</p>\n        <ul class=\"ilist\">\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 2l4 4-4 4M3 11V9a3 3 0 013-3h15M7 22l-4-4 4-4M21 13v2a3 3 0 01-3 3H3\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Lifecycle Workflows</b> for joiners, movers and leavers</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M9 7h.01M15 7h.01M9 11h.01M15 11h.01M9 15h.01M15 15h.01M10 21v-3h4v3\"></path></svg></i><span>HR-driven provisioning from Workday or SuccessFactors</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 8l-9-5-9 5 9 5 9-5z\"></path><path d=\"M3 8v8l9 5 9-5V8M12 13v8\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Access packages</b> auto-assigned by department or role</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></i><span>ML-assisted <b>access reviews</b> and Privileged Identity Management</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"more\" href=\"/microsoft-entra-id-governance\">Explore ID Governance <span class=\"ar\">→</span></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card ins rv\">\n        <div class=\"ih\"><div class=\"ico r\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 11v3a8 8 0 01-2 5M8 7.5A6 6 0 0118 11v1M6 11a6 6 0 01.5-2.5M16 14a14 14 0 01-1 5M4 15c.5-1.3.5-2.6.5-4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"tagline\">P2-level protection</span></div>\n        <h3>ID Protection</h3>\n        <p>Real-time sign-in and user risk, so policy can step up, block or force a password change.</p>\n        <ul class=\"ilist\">\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 001.7 3h17a2 2 0 001.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 00-3.4 0zM12 9v4M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></i><span>Detects <b>leaked credentials</b>, password spray and anonymous IPs</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-6 7-12a7 7 0 00-14 0c0 6 7 12 7 12z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"></circle></svg></i><span>Flags impossible travel and unfamiliar sign-in properties</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 14l4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.3 17a9 9 0 1117.4 0\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Risk-based Conditional Access</b> for users and sign-ins</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 16V11a6 6 0 00-12 0v5l-2 2h16zM10 20a2 2 0 004 0\"></path></svg></i><span>Risky-user reports, alerts and MFA registration policy</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"more\" href=\"/microsoft-entra-id-p2\">Compare with Entra ID P2 <span class=\"ar\">→</span></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card ins rv\" data-d=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"ih\"><div class=\"ico g\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M14 10h5M14 14h4M5 17a3.5 3.5 0 016 0\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"tagline\">Suite exclusive</span></div>\n        <h3>Verified ID + Face Check</h3>\n        <p>High-assurance identity checks: a live selfie matched to the photo on a verified ID credential.</p>\n        <ul class=\"ilist\">\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M2 21a7 7 0 0114 0M16 11l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Face Check</b> — real-time selfie-to-credential match</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 15v-3a8 8 0 0116 0v3\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"14\" width=\"5\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"14\" width=\"5\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></i><span>Stops help-desk password-reset impersonation</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 11l9-8 9 8M5 9.5V21h14V9.5\"></path></svg></i><span>Verifies remote new hires before day one</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M10.5 19.5L10 23l2-1 2 1-.5-3.5M7 7h10M7 10h6\"></path></svg></i><span>Issue and verify digital credentials</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"more\" href=\"#face-check\">How Face Check works <span class=\"ar\">→</span></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ins-core rv\" data-d=\"2\">\n        <span class=\"k\">The glue</span>\n        <h3>One Conditional Access engine</h3>\n        <p>Write a policy once — \"finance users on compliant devices, low risk, MFA\" — and it applies to private apps, websites, SaaS and AI tools alike.</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\">\n          <span class=\"chip\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M4 21a8 8 0 0116 0\"></path></svg></i>Who</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#FF8C1A\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"></path></svg></i>Device</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#c0392b\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 14l4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.3 17a9 9 0 1117.4 0\"></path></svg></i>Risk</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#16a34a\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-6 7-12a7 7 0 00-14 0c0 6 7 12 7 12z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"></circle></svg></i>Location</span><span class=\"chip\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect></svg></i>App or site</span>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-orange btn-sm\" href=\"#configure\">Price the Suite <span class=\"ar\">→</span></a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec alt\" id=\"face-check\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"fc-grid\">\n      <div class=\"fc-copy rv\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Verified ID · Face Check</span>\n        <h2>Prove it's really them — <span class=\"acc\">in under a minute.</span></h2>\n        <p>Attackers no longer need to break MFA. They phone the help desk, sound convincing and ask for a reset. Face Check asks the caller for a live selfie and compares it with the photo on a verified ID credential they already hold. No match, no reset.</p>\n        <ul class=\"ilist\">\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2M17 3h2a2 2 0 012 2v2M21 17v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2M7 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2M3 12h18\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Real-time liveness and face match</b> against the credential photo</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></i><span>Your app receives a <b>match result and confidence score</b>, not the selfie</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 007 0l3-3a5 5 0 00-7-7l-1 1M14 11a5 5 0 00-7 0l-3 3a5 5 0 007 7l1-1\"></path></svg></i><span>Triggered from the help-desk tool, an onboarding portal or a Conditional Access flow</span></li>\n          <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path></svg></i><span>Supports DPDP Act principles of purpose limitation and data minimisation</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"tabs\" data-tabs=\"fc\" role=\"tablist\">\n          <button data-tab=\"hd\" class=\"on\" role=\"tab\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 15v-3a8 8 0 0116 0v3\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"14\" width=\"5\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"14\" width=\"5\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg> Help-desk reset</button>\n          <button data-tab=\"ob\" role=\"tab\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M2 21a7 7 0 0114 0M16 11l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Remote onboarding</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fc-panels rv\" data-d=\"2\">\n        <div data-panel=\"hd\" data-group=\"fc\" class=\"on\">\n          <div class=\"fcp\">\n            <div class=\"risk\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 001.7 3h17a2 2 0 001.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 00-3.4 0zM12 9v4M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></i><div><b>The risk</b><span>A caller claiming to be your CFO asks for an MFA reset. Security questions and call-backs are easy to social-engineer.</span></div></div>\n            <ol class=\"fsteps\">\n              <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 01-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 01-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 012.1 4.2 2 2 0 014.1 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 01-.5 2.1L8 9.9a16 16 0 006 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 012.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 011.7 2z\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Caller asks for a reset</b><span>Agent opens the ticket and sends a Face Check request to the user's phone.</span></div></li>\n              <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M14 10h5M14 14h4M5 17a3.5 3.5 0 016 0\"></path></svg></i><div><b>User presents their credential</b><span>The Verified ID in their wallet carries a trusted photo.</span></div></li>\n              <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2M17 3h2a2 2 0 012 2v2M21 17v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2M7 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2M3 12h18\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Live selfie is matched</b><span>Liveness check plus face match against that photo, in seconds.</span></div></li>\n              <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"15\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M11 12l9-9M17 6l3 3M14 9l2 2\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Reset only on a match</b><span>The agent sees pass or fail and proceeds — or escalates.</span></div></li>\n            </ol>\n            <div class=\"out\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i>Impersonators fail at step 3. Genuine users are back in without a desk visit.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div data-panel=\"ob\" data-group=\"fc\">\n          <div class=\"fcp\">\n            <div class=\"risk\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 001.7 3h17a2 2 0 001.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 00-3.4 0zM12 9v4M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></i><div><b>The risk</b><span>A remote hire in another city collects a laptop and credentials. Who actually turned up to day one?</span></div></div>\n            <ol class=\"fsteps\">\n              <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h6\"></path></svg></i><div><b>ID document checked</b><span>The new hire completes an identity-verification step and receives a Verified ID.</span></div></li>\n              <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h2M17 3h2a2 2 0 012 2v2M21 17v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2M7 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2M3 12h18\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Face Check before access</b><span>A live selfie is matched to that credential at first sign-in.</span></div></li>\n              <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 8l-9-5-9 5 9 5 9-5z\"></path><path d=\"M3 8v8l9 5 9-5V8M12 13v8\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Access package assigned</b><span>ID Governance grants the role's apps automatically.</span></div></li>\n              <li><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 11v3a8 8 0 01-2 5M8 7.5A6 6 0 0118 11v1M6 11a6 6 0 01.5-2.5M16 14a14 14 0 01-1 5M4 15c.5-1.3.5-2.6.5-4\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Passwordless from day one</b><span>The verified user sets up phishing-resistant sign-in.</span></div></li>\n            </ol>\n            <div class=\"out\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i>The person who signs in is the person you hired — verified remotely, without a branch visit.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Before and after</span><h2>Four tool stacks become <span class=\"acc\">one licence.</span></h2><p>A typical mid-size estate runs a VPN, a web proxy, a separate MFA product and access managed by tickets and spreadsheets. Here is what changes when the Suite takes over.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"tbl-w rv\">\n      <table class=\"tbl ba\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Legacy stack</th><th class=\"hl\">With Entra Suite</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Remote access to internal apps</td><td>VPN gives the whole network once connected; inbound ports exposed</td><td class=\"hl\">Per-app access, policy per app, outbound-only connectors</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Web and SaaS filtering</td><td>Separate proxy appliance with its own rules and user list</td><td class=\"hl\">Web filtering driven by the same Conditional Access policy</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Generative AI use</td><td>Unknown which AI apps staff use or what they paste</td><td class=\"hl\">Shadow AI discovery and prompt-injection protection</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Sign-in security</td><td>Same MFA prompt for every login, regardless of risk</td><td class=\"hl\">Risk-based policy: allow, step up or block in real time</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Joiners, movers, leavers</td><td>IT tickets; leavers keep access for days</td><td class=\"hl\">Lifecycle Workflows triggered from HR data</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Access reviews</td><td>Yearly spreadsheet sent to managers</td><td class=\"hl\">Scheduled reviews with ML-assisted recommendations</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Help-desk identity proofing</td><td>Security questions and call-backs</td><td class=\"hl\">Face Check against a verified ID credential</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Consoles and vendors</td><td>4 consoles, 4 contracts, 4 renewal dates</td><td class=\"hl\">1 admin centre, 1 licence, 1 XcellHost invoice</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"india rv\">\n      <span class=\"k\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 22V4M4 4h12l-2 4 2 4H4\"></path></svg> India lens</span>\n      <div class=\"chips\">\n        <span class=\"chip\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h6\"></path></svg></i>DPDP Act 2023 — access control &amp; audit trails</span>\n        <span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#FF8C1A\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg></i>CERT-In — logging &amp; 6-hour reporting</span>\n        <span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#041E42\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M9 7h.01M15 7h.01M9 11h.01M15 11h.01M9 15h.01M15 15h.01M10 21v-3h4v3\"></path></svg></i>RBI / SEBI / IRDAI — MFA, privileged access, reviews</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>The Suite helps you meet these obligations; it does not make you compliant on its own. We map controls to your regulator's guidance during setup.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec alt\" id=\"pricing\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Pricing</span><h2>Below Microsoft list, <span class=\"acc\">billed in rupees.</span></h2><p>Per user, with a GST invoice. Pay monthly, or pay for the year upfront and save more.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"pr-grid\">\n      <div class=\"ez-card rv\" id=\"pcard\"><span class=\"ez-off\">BEST PRICE</span>\n        <div class=\"ez-top\"><span class=\"ez-ms\"><span class=\"msq\"><i style=\"background:#F25022\"></i><i style=\"background:#7FBA00\"></i><i style=\"background:#00A4EF\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFB900\"></i></span>Microsoft</span><a class=\"ez-ext\" href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/security/business/microsoft-entra-pricing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Microsoft pricing page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M8.6 13.5l6.8 4M15.4 6.5l-6.8 4\"></path></svg></a></div>\n        <div class=\"ez-fam\">Microsoft Entra</div>\n        <h3>Microsoft Entra Suite</h3>\n        <div class=\"ez-sku\">Per user · requires Entra ID P1 per user</div>\n        <div class=\"ez-row\"><span>Microsoft official</span><s id=\"pcList\">₹1,000</s></div>\n        <div class=\"ez-gst\">per user / month</div>\n        <div class=\"ez-pr\"><span class=\"ez-tag m\">Monthly</span><span><span class=\"ez-amt\" id=\"pcM\">₹910</span> <small style=\"color:#9fb6de\">/ user / mo</small></span></div>\n        <div class=\"ez-pr\"><span class=\"ez-tag y\">Yearly</span><span><span class=\"ez-amt\" id=\"pcY\">₹10,560</span> <small style=\"color:#9fb6de\">/ user / yr</small></span></div>\n        <div class=\"ez-save\"><span>Yearly vs Microsoft list</span><b id=\"pcSave\">Save 12%</b></div>\n        <div class=\"ez-cta\"><a href=\"tel:+912267111555\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 01-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 01-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 012.1 4.2 2 2 0 014.1 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 01-.5 2.1L8 9.9a16 16 0 006 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 012.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 011.7 2z\"></path></svg>Call now</a><a class=\"q\" href=\"#\" data-open=\"xhCallback\" data-topic=\"Entra Suite — volume quote\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h6\"></path></svg>Get quotation</a></div>\n        <a href=\"#configure\" class=\"ez-buy\" id=\"pcGo\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center\">Configure &amp; Buy →</a>\n        <div class=\"ez-gst\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0\">Indicative · excl. 18% GST</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pr-side\">\n        <div class=\"prereq rv\" data-d=\"1\">\n          <div class=\"ico o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"15\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M11 12l9-9M17 6l3 3M14 9l2 2\"></path></svg></div>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span>\n            <h3>Every Suite user needs Entra ID P1</h3>\n            <p>Most businesses already have it. It's included in:</p>\n            <div class=\"chips\">\n              <span class=\"chip\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"></path></svg></i>M365 Business Premium</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#041E42\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"></path></svg></i>M365 E3 / E5</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#FF8C1A\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><path d=\"M2 20a7 7 0 0114 0M17 11a3 3 0 000-6M22 20a6 6 0 00-4-5.6\"></path></svg></i>M365 F1 / F3</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#16a34a\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path></svg></i>EMS E3 / E5</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"sm\">Not covered? Add standalone <a href=\"/microsoft-entra-id-p1\">Entra ID P1</a> at <b id=\"p1Price\">₹528</b> / user / month — or tick \"Add P1\" in the calculator below.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p2note rv\" data-d=\"2\">\n          <div class=\"ico n\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.6 13.4L13.4 20.6a2 2 0 01-2.8 0L3 13V3h10l7.6 7.6a2 2 0 010 2.8z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"1.5\"></circle></svg></div>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"k\">Already on P2 or Microsoft 365 E5?</span>\n            <h3>Ask about step-up pricing</h3>\n            <p>You already pay for ID Protection. Microsoft offers special Suite pricing to Entra ID P2 and E5 customers — we'll check eligibility and quote the difference.</p>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-blue btn-sm\" data-open=\"xhCallback\" data-topic=\"Entra Suite — P2 / E5 customer pricing\">Check my pricing <span class=\"ar\">→</span></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"configure\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Configure &amp; buy</span><h2>Licence every user <span class=\"acc\">in seconds.</span></h2><p>Choose seats and billing. You'll see your price next to Microsoft's list price, with GST worked out.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"calc rv\" id=\"seatCalc\">\n      <div class=\"cin\">\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"sNum\">Users to licence <small id=\"sNumL\">50 users</small></label>\n          <div class=\"seatrow\"><div class=\"stp\"><button type=\"button\" data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Fewer users\">−</button><input type=\"number\" id=\"sNum\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"50\" aria-label=\"Users\"><button type=\"button\" data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"More users\">+</button></div>\n          <input class=\"rng\" type=\"range\" id=\"sRng\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"50\" aria-label=\"Users slider\"></div>\n          <div class=\"hint\">Over 300 seats? <a href=\"#\" data-open=\"xhCallback\" data-topic=\"Entra Suite — volume quote\">Ask for volume pricing</a>.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"fld\"><span class=\"lb\">Billing</span>\n          <div class=\"seg\" id=\"sBill\"><button data-v=\"m\">Monthly<small id=\"sBillM\">₹910 / user / mo</small></button><button data-v=\"y\" class=\"on\">Yearly<small id=\"sBillY\">₹10,560 / user · save 3%</small></button></div></div>\n        <label class=\"tgl\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sP1\"><span class=\"sw\"></span><span>Add Entra ID P1 for these users<small>Only if they don't have Microsoft 365 Business Premium, E3, E5 or EMS. Adds <b id=\"sP1Rate\">₹6,125 / user / yr</b>.</small></span></label>\n        <div class=\"incl\">\n          <span class=\"k\">Every seat includes</span>\n          <div class=\"chips\">\n            <span class=\"chip\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"11\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 11V8a4 4 0 018 0v3\"></path></svg></i>Private Access</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#FF8C1A\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 010 18M12 3a14 14 0 000 18\"></path></svg></i>Internet Access</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#041E42\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><path d=\"M2 20a7 7 0 0114 0M17 11a3 3 0 000-6M22 20a6 6 0 00-4-5.6\"></path></svg></i>ID Governance</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#c0392b\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 11v3a8 8 0 01-2 5M8 7.5A6 6 0 0118 11v1M6 11a6 6 0 01.5-2.5M16 14a14 14 0 01-1 5M4 15c.5-1.3.5-2.6.5-4\"></path></svg></i>ID Protection</span><span class=\"chip\"><i style=\"background:#16a34a\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M14 10h5M14 14h4M5 17a3.5 3.5 0 016 0\"></path></svg></i>Face Check</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cout\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <span class=\"ck\" id=\"oK\">Your yearly total</span>\n        <div class=\"ctot\" id=\"oTot\">₹0</div>\n        <div class=\"csub\" id=\"oSub\">for 50 users, 12 months, excl. GST</div>\n        <div class=\"crows\">\n          <div class=\"crow\"><span>Per user</span><b id=\"oPer\">₹0</b></div>\n          <div class=\"crow\"><span>Microsoft list, same users</span><b><s id=\"oList\">₹0</s></b></div>\n          <div class=\"crow save\"><span>You save vs Microsoft</span><b id=\"oSave\">₹0</b></div>\n          <div class=\"crow\" id=\"oP1Row\" hidden=\"\"><span>Entra ID P1 add-on</span><b id=\"oP1\">₹0</b></div>\n          <div class=\"crow\"><span>GST (18%)</span><b id=\"oGst\">₹0</b></div>\n          <div class=\"crow tot\"><span>Payable incl. GST</span><b id=\"oPay\">₹0</b></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cact\"><button class=\"btn btn-orange btn-block\" id=\"oAdd\" type=\"button\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1.5\"></circle><path d=\"M2 3h3l2.6 13.4a1.5 1.5 0 001.5 1.1h9.5a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.2L22 7H6\"></path></svg> Add to cart</button><button class=\"btn btn-line btn-block\" type=\"button\" data-open=\"xhCallback\" data-topic=\"Entra Suite — buy licences\">Get quotation</button></div>\n        <div class=\"cfine\">Prices in INR excl. 18% GST. Microsoft list shown for comparison. Final price on your GST invoice.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec alt\" id=\"bundle\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Bundle value</span><h2>Suite vs buying the parts <span class=\"acc\">one by one.</span></h2><p>Same users, same capabilities — priced separately at our rates, then as one Suite. The formula is shown in full below the chart.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"bv rv\" id=\"bv\">\n      <div class=\"bv-in\">\n        <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"bNum\">Users <small id=\"bNumL\">100 users</small></label>\n          <div class=\"seatrow\"><div class=\"stp\"><button type=\"button\" data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Fewer users\">−</button><input type=\"number\" id=\"bNum\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"100\" aria-label=\"Users\"><button type=\"button\" data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"More users\">+</button></div>\n          <input class=\"rng\" type=\"range\" id=\"bRng\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"100\" aria-label=\"Users slider\"></div></div>\n        <label class=\"tgl\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"bIdp\" checked=\"\"><span class=\"sw\"></span><span>Include ID Protection<small>Separately this needs the P2 uplift (P2 ₹755 − P1 ₹528 = ₹227 / user / mo).</small></span></label>\n        <label class=\"tgl\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"bHasP1\"><span class=\"sw\"></span><span>I already have P1<small>e.g. through Microsoft 365 Business Premium, E3 or E5.</small></span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bv-out\">\n        <div class=\"bars\" id=\"bvBars\">\n          <div class=\"bar-row\"><div class=\"bl\"><b>Buying separately</b><span id=\"bvSepPer\">₹0 / user / mo</span></div><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"stack\" id=\"bvSep\"></div></div></div>\n          <div class=\"bar-row suite\"><div class=\"bl\"><b>Entra Suite</b><span id=\"bvSuitePer\">₹0 / user / mo</span></div><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"stack\" id=\"bvSuite\"></div></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"legend\" id=\"bvLegend\"></div>\n        <div class=\"bv-kpis\">\n          <div><span>Saving / month</span><b id=\"bvMo\">₹0</b></div>\n          <div><span>Saving / year</span><b id=\"bvYr\">₹0</b></div>\n          <div><span>Cheaper by</span><b id=\"bvPct\">0%</b></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"formula\" id=\"bvFormula\"></div>\n        <div class=\"bv-act\"><button class=\"btn btn-orange\" type=\"button\" id=\"bvAdd\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1.5\"></circle><path d=\"M2 3h3l2.6 13.4a1.5 1.5 0 001.5 1.1h9.5a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.2L22 7H6\"></path></svg> Add Suite to cart</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"button\" data-open=\"xhCallback\" data-topic=\"Entra Suite — buy licences\">Talk to an Entra specialist</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"fit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Plan finder</span><h2>Which Entra plan <span class=\"acc\">fits you?</span></h2><p>Answer six questions. We'll price every valid combination of P1, P2, ID Governance, Internet Access, Private Access and the Suite, and show you the cheapest one that covers what you need.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"rec rv\" id=\"rec\">\n      <div class=\"rq\" id=\"recQs\"></div>\n      <aside class=\"ra\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <span class=\"k\">Cheapest fit</span>\n        <h3 id=\"raTitle\">Entra ID P1</h3>\n        <p id=\"raWhy\"></p>\n        <div class=\"ra-skus\" id=\"raSkus\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ra-price\"><div><b id=\"raPer\">₹0</b><span>per user / month</span></div><div><b id=\"raYr\">₹0</b><span>per user / year</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"ra-alt\" id=\"raAlt\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ra-opts\">\n          <label class=\"tgl\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"raHasP1\"><span class=\"sw\"></span><span>We already have P1<small>via Microsoft 365 BP / E3 / E5</small></span></label>\n          <div class=\"fld\"><label for=\"raN\">Users</label><div class=\"stp\"><button type=\"button\" data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Fewer users\">−</button><input type=\"number\" id=\"raN\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"50\" aria-label=\"Users\"><button type=\"button\" data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"More users\">+</button></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ra-act\"><button class=\"btn btn-orange btn-block\" type=\"button\" id=\"raAdd\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1.5\"></circle><path d=\"M2 3h3l2.6 13.4a1.5 1.5 0 001.5 1.1h9.5a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.2L22 7H6\"></path></svg> <span>Add to cart · <span id=\"raTot\">₹0</span>/mo</span></button><button class=\"btn btn-line btn-block\" type=\"button\" data-open=\"xhCallback\" data-topic=\"Which Entra plan do I need?\">Get a quote for this plan</button></div>\n      </aside>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"why\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Why buy from XcellHost</span><h2>Microsoft's licence, <span class=\"acc\">our engineers.</span></h2><p>Moving off a VPN and proxy touches every user. We plan it, pilot it and stay on call — from Mumbai, since 1999.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"dband rv\"><div><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 4h12M6 9h12M15 20L8 13h2a4 4 0 000-8\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Genuine licences, INR billing</b><p>Microsoft licences on your own tenant, invoiced in rupees with GST — pay by UPI, card or bank transfer.</p></span><span class=\"n\">01</span></div><div><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 015 5L12 19a2.8 2.8 0 01-4-4z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3l3 3-2 2-3-3\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Expert setup</b><p>Tenant review, Conditional Access design, a pilot group and a phased rollout — nobody gets locked out.</p></span><span class=\"n\">02</span></div><div><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 4l-4 4 4 4M3 8h14M17 20l4-4-4-4M21 16H7\"></path></svg></i><span><b>VPN &amp; proxy migration</b><p>We map VPN apps to Private Access, rebuild web rules in Internet Access and move users in waves.</p></span><span class=\"n\">03</span></div><div><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 15v-3a8 8 0 0116 0v3\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"14\" width=\"5\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"14\" width=\"5\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></i><span><b>24×7 support from Mumbai</b><p>Our NOC and SOC answer on phone, WhatsApp and tickets, round the clock, in your time zone.</p></span><span class=\"n\">04</span></div><div><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 01-10 0zM17 5h3v2a3 3 0 01-3 3M7 5H4v2a3 3 0 003 3\"></path></svg></i><span><b>Microsoft Gold Partner</b><p>A Microsoft partner team designing and deploying Entra and Microsoft 365 for Indian businesses.</p></span><span class=\"n\">05</span></div><div><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h6\"></path></svg></i><span><b>One invoice</b><p>The Suite sits on the same GST invoice as your Microsoft 365 — one vendor, one renewal date.</p></span><span class=\"n\">06</span></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sec alt\" id=\"family\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sh rv\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The Entra family</span><h2>Need just one piece? <span class=\"acc\">Buy it on its own.</span></h2><p>Every Suite component — and the identity plans underneath — is available separately.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fam\" id=\"fam\"></div>\n    <a class=\"fam-all rv\" href=\"/microsoft-entra-id\">Compare all Entra plans <span class=\"ar\">→</span></a>\n  </div>\n</section>";
export const SUITE_HERO = "<div class=\"stage\" data-in=\"4\">\n        <span class=\"lh-orbit\"></span><span class=\"lh-orbit o2\"></span>\n        <div class=\"lh-chip\" style=\"top:-22px;right:-26px\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M2 21a7 7 0 0114 0M16 11l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i><span>Identity verified<small>Verified ID · Face Check passed</small></span></div>\n        <div class=\"lh-chip c2\" style=\"top:252px;left:-52px\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"11\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 11V8a4 4 0 018 0v3\"></path></svg></i><span>VPN retired<small>Private Access · per-app tunnel</small></span></div>\n        <div class=\"lh-tilt\"><div class=\"upol\" id=\"upol\" aria-label=\"Animated example: one Conditional Access policy governing five Entra Suite products through an employee's day\">\n          <div class=\"uh\"><b><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></i>Conditional Access <em>· one policy</em></b><span class=\"clock\" id=\"upClock\">Day 1 · 09:00</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ud\" id=\"upDiag\">\n            <svg class=\"ulines\" id=\"upLines\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg>\n            <div class=\"core\" id=\"upCore\"><span class=\"ck\">Policy engine</span><b>Zero Trust baseline</b><span class=\"dec\" id=\"upDec\">Evaluating…</span></div>\n            <div class=\"mod\" data-i=\"0\" style=\"--x:50%;--y:12%\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M14 10h5M14 14h4M5 17a3.5 3.5 0 016 0\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Verified ID</b><span>Face Check</span></div></div>\n            <div class=\"mod\" data-i=\"1\" style=\"--x:81%;--y:36%\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><path d=\"M2 20a7 7 0 0114 0M17 11a3 3 0 000-6M22 20a6 6 0 00-4-5.6\"></path></svg></i><div><b>ID Governance</b><span>Access packages</span></div></div>\n            <div class=\"mod\" data-i=\"2\" style=\"--x:74%;--y:87%\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"11\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 11V8a4 4 0 018 0v3\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Private Access</b><span>Per-app ZTNA</span></div></div>\n            <div class=\"mod\" data-i=\"3\" style=\"--x:26%;--y:87%\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 010 18M12 3a14 14 0 000 18\"></path></svg></i><div><b>Internet Access</b><span>Web &amp; AI gateway</span></div></div>\n            <div class=\"mod\" data-i=\"4\" style=\"--x:19%;--y:36%\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 11v3a8 8 0 01-2 5M8 7.5A6 6 0 0118 11v1M6 11a6 6 0 01.5-2.5M16 14a14 14 0 01-1 5M4 15c.5-1.3.5-2.6.5-4\"></path></svg></i><div><b>ID Protection</b><span>Sign-in risk</span></div></div>\n            <span class=\"pulse\" id=\"upPulse\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"uf\">\n            <div class=\"ev\" id=\"upEv\"><em>09:00</em><span>A new hire starts the day…</span></div>\n            <div class=\"tl\" id=\"upTl\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lh-powered\"><small>Powered by</small><span><span class=\"msq\"><i style=\"background:#F25022\"></i><i style=\"background:#7FBA00\"></i><i style=\"background:#00A4EF\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFB900\"></i></span>Microsoft</span></div>\n      </div>";
export const SUITE_FAQS: [string,string][] = [["Do I need Entra ID P1 as well?","Yes. Every Suite user needs Entra ID P1. It's already included in Microsoft 365 Business Premium, E3, E5, F1/F3 and EMS E3/E5. If your users don't have it, add standalone P1 at ₹528 per user per month — the calculator above can include it."],["We already have Entra ID P2 or Microsoft 365 E5. Is there a discount?","Microsoft offers special Suite pricing to existing P2 and E5 customers, since ID Protection is already covered. Contact us with your current licence count and we'll confirm eligibility and quote the difference."],["Can Private Access fully replace our VPN?","For most businesses, yes. Start with Quick Access to tunnel the same IP ranges and hostnames your VPN covers, then move to per-app access with separate policies. Private network connectors run on Windows Server and make outbound-only connections over port 443, so nothing is exposed inbound. RDP, SSH, SMB shares, SAP, internal web apps and databases all work."],["How does Face Check handle personal data?","The user takes a live selfie that is compared with the photo in a Verified ID credential they hold. The requesting app receives a match result and confidence score, not the selfie itself. Under the DPDP Act you'll still need a clear purpose and notice for using it — we help you draft both."],["Can Internet Access run alongside our existing proxy or SSE?","Yes. It can run side by side with a third-party security service edge, so you can migrate traffic profiles one at a time. Branch connectivity through remote networks needs at least 50 combined P1 and Internet Access licences."],["Which devices are supported?","The Global Secure Access client runs on Windows, macOS, iOS and Android. Branch offices can also connect without a client through remote network links."],["Do I have to licence every employee?","Licence every user who benefits from a Suite feature. For governance, that includes people whose access is reviewed and the reviewers; for PIM, eligible users and approvers. We'll size it with you so you don't over- or under-buy."],["What's the difference between monthly and yearly billing?","Monthly is ₹910 per user, billed each month. Yearly is ₹10,560 per user for 12 months, paid upfront — cheaper than 12 monthly payments and 12% below Microsoft's list price. Both are excl. 18% GST."],["Do I get a GST invoice?","Yes. Every order comes with a GST-compliant invoice from XcellHost Cloud Services Pvt. Ltd. Pay by UPI, card, net banking or bank transfer."]];
